# Verbatim evidence records copied out of a gitignored `results/` run
# directory and sha256-verified. `core.autocrlf=input` would silently strip the
# CRLF line endings the training CSVs were written with, so the committed blob
# would NOT be byte-identical to the artifact it claims to preserve. `-text`
# stores these bytes exactly as they are on disk. Do not remove.
* -text
